<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>接听模式</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>方案2需先关闭 iOS 自动接听；白名单是排除名单。号码不可得且名单非空时拒绝接听。公开 CXCall 不提供电话号码。方案1仅引导手动启用系统功能，不发送插件事务。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSLinkListCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.autoanswer.call</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Mode</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>2</integer>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>1</integer>
				<integer>2</integer>
			</array>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>接听模式</string>
			<key>detail</key>
			<string>PSListItemsController</string>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>方案1：系统备选（全来电）</string>
				<string>方案2：插件排除白名单（默认）</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.autoanswer.call</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用插件策略</string>
			<key>subtitle</key>
			<string>两种模式均读取；不控制 iOS 独立总开关</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>立即停止插件策略（不关系统开关）</string>
			<key>action</key><string>stopPlugin:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>恢复插件策略（解除电话端停止锁存）</string>
			<key>action</key><string>resumePlugin:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>来电等待 N 秒后请求接听</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>从电话模块收到首个符合条件的来电事件开始，等待下方 N 秒，再重新检查 Enabled、模式、通话状态和排除名单后请求接听。不是从实测铃声开始计时；观察器状态未知或无事件时不调度，不能推断此前已经响铃多久。没有 pong 不代表已验证接听。秒数仅控制方案2，不控制系统自动接听。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.autoanswer.call</string>
			<key>key</key><string>Delay</string>
			<key>default</key><real>0.5</real>
			<key>label</key><string>等待秒数 N（0～60 秒）</string>
			<key>placeholder</key><string>例如 5 = 等待5秒</string>
			<key>get</key><string>readDelay:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setDelay:specifier:</string>
			<key>keyboard</key><string>DecimalPad</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.autoanswer.call</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Whitelist</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>不自动接听白名单</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>完整号码，逗号分隔；不支持片段或通配符</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>接听后音频</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>可多选导入，每个文件最多5MB，追加不覆盖。音频库中点行选择，ⓘ 可试听/停止/逐项删除；只发布所选音频。旧单曲自动登记，原文件不搬移。音频仍位于设置沙盒，不保证电话进程可读，不是上行注入。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.autoanswer.call</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>PlayAudio</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>本地播放意愿（连接归因不明时禁播）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>导入音频文件</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>pickAudio:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>试听已导入音频</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>testAudio:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>音频库：选择 / 试听 / 逐项删除</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showAudioLibrary:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>iOS 原生自动接听（独立于插件）</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>系统状态必须单独读取，不能从插件开关推断。关闭按钮仅在 AXSettings 已核实签名且运行时 ABI 校验通过时调用原生 setter 并回读；不可用时明确报错，不写猜测偏好键。深链是否直达页面未在 iOS17.3 实机验证。手动路径：设置 → 辅助功能 → 触控 → 通话音频路由 → 自动接听通话。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>读取系统开关状态（可能不可用）</string>
			<key>action</key><string>systemStatus:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>一键关闭系统自动接听（须通过校验）</string>
			<key>action</key><string>disableSystem:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>直接尝试原生自动接听页（深链未验证）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>openSystemAutoAnswer:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>设置模块日志与音频信息</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showLog:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>自动接听记录</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showCallRecords:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>证据采集（1.12.0）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>1.12.0 采集证据并支持双宿主：注入范围现为 com.apple.mobilephone、com.apple.springboard、com.apple.InCallService、com.apple.incallservice 四个标识（手机号标识只允许小写 com.apple.mobilephone；两个 InCall 拼写仅覆盖大小写差异，重复或不存在的标识无害）。每个已加载模块在载入时及每约 20 秒发送一条按进程区分的 Darwin 通知（com.autoanswer.call.probe.&lt;进程&gt;）；每个接听宿主另有自己的 pong 名与自己的运行时发现文件（aac-incall.discovery.txt / aac-springboard.discovery.txt），设置页逐宿主标注来源与路径。接听只由一个宿主提交：角色表 InCallService(2) &gt; SpringBoard(1) &gt; 仅日志(0)，其余宿主只观察记录。共享日志会按顺序尝试多个绝对候选路径并记录命中哪一个；跨进程可写/可读并未验证，失败时回退到自有 CFPreferences 域且不声称可见。本版本未在设备上安装或验证，不能说明自动接听可用。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>进程探测 / 环境清单</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>probeProcesses:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>接听宿主运行时发现 / 挂钩结果（InCallService / SpringBoard 逐宿主）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showDiscovery:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>共享日志查看器（逐候选路径尝试）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showSharedLogs:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>电话模块诊断（可能不可见）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showPhoneDiagnostics:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>清除设置模块日志</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>clearLog:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>探测电话模块（Darwin ping）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>pingPhone:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>导出持久配置（plist）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>exportConfig:</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>1.12.0：InCallService 优先的双宿主接听版。音频最大5MB且仍位于设置沙盒；本地试听不代表电话进程能读取，也不会注入通话上行。InCallService 与 SpringBoard 使用同一套运行时发现 + 动态挂钩逻辑：只有发现了可挂钩接听方法、且没有更高优先级接听宿主存活的那个宿主执行接听；其余宿主只观察记录，并明确写出 observer only, answer owned by &lt;宿主&gt;。设备证据（1.11.0，19:46:53 实测）：SpringBoard 的检测、延时与策略层工作正常，但它没有可挂钩的接听 UI，公开事务回退失败于 com.apple.CallKit.error.requesttransaction code 1 = unknownCallUUID（本进程的 CXCallController 不拥有蜂窝通话），因此公开事务路径在本设备上无效，只做一次带含义说明的诊断尝试。共享日志路径与进程探测结果均为本机实际读数，未在设备安装验证，不构成自动接听可用的证据。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
